# NetForge — Resources, Accountability & Progress Tracker
Date: 2026-08-28

## Actions Taken

### New Features
1. **Resource Library** (`/resources`)
   - Added `lib/resources.ts` with 40+ curated resources (docs, books, videos, labs, cert prep, tools, communities)
   - Search, filter by type/phase, and free-only toggle

2. **Accountability Tracker** (`/accountability`)
   - Daily check-in (studied, hours, reflection)
   - Weekly commitment goal setting
   - Streak hero with current/longest streak
   - Accountability score (consistency + module + day progress)
   - Activity heatmap calendar
   - Recent check-in history
   - Settings: start date, reset progress

3. **Improved Progress Tracker**
   - New `ProgressTracker` component on dashboard
   - Module + today completion rings
   - Week progress bar and daily block indicators
   - Study activity heatmap
   - Drill stats (accuracy, best streak)
   - Today page shows block progress bar

### Data Model Extensions (`lib/types.ts`, `lib/progress.ts`)
- `longestStreak`, `studyHistory`, `weeklyGoal`, `checkIns`, `drillStats`, `labSetupComplete`
- New hooks: `setWeeklyGoal`, `recordCheckIn`, `recordDrillResult`, `toggleLabSetup`, `isModuleComplete`
- Helpers: `getWeekProgress`, `getStudyHeatmapData`, `getAccountabilityScore`, `daysSinceStart`

### Integration
- Curriculum modules: mark complete via `ModuleCard` component
- Subnet drills: persist all-time stats and best streak
- Lab setup: functional persisted checkboxes
- Sidebar: added Accountability and Resources nav items

### New Files
- `lib/resources.ts`
- `app/resources/page.tsx`
- `app/accountability/page.tsx`
- `components/StreakCalendar.tsx`
- `components/ProgressTracker.tsx`
- `components/ModuleCard.tsx`
- `components/LabSetupChecklist.tsx`
